{"name": "Goodnight, B", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Goodnight, B</strong> is a fully single-player 2D puzzle platformer set in a dream world. You play as B, a bright, nightmare-plagued girl who has loving but frequently absent parents. She likes to find solace in her friends, like her teddy bear. Follow B's story as she learns things about the world that her parents couldn't teach her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"325\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662140/extras/5460c569d66c004f1be0e02d19e5e844.avif?t=1786691862\" width=\"1374\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662140/extras/b00034586f6ef7d1c1d25ba993eb655f.poster.avif?t=1786691862\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662140/extras/b00034586f6ef7d1c1d25ba993eb655f.webm?t=1786691862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662140/extras/b00034586f6ef7d1c1d25ba993eb655f.mp4?t=1786691862\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically manipulate portions of each level.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep gravity in mind. (Or else...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always have a backup plan in case something goes wrong. (Press R)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"325\" src=\